<title>FRANCE: Credito Bergamasco deal expected this week-sources.</title>
<headline>Credito Bergamasco deal expected this week-sources.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French state-owned bank Credit Lyonnais is expected to sign a deal on Wednesday under which it will sell its Credito Bergamasco (Creberg) unit to Banca Popolare di Verona, a source close to the bank said.</p>
<p>At Credit Lyonnais there was no comment on newspaper reports saying the deal was imminent.</p>
<p>Credit Lyonnais has 56.8 percent of Creberg.</p>
</text>
